<title>USA: PP&amp;L Resources unit issues $100 mln TOPRS.</title>
<headline>PP&amp;L Resources unit issues $100 mln TOPRS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of trust</p>
<p>originated preferred stock (TOPRS) from PP&amp;L Capital Trust, a</p>
<p>unit of PP&amp;L Resources Inc, was priced on Thursday, according</p>
<p>to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER PP&amp;L CAPITAL TRUST</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 8.20 PCT   MATURITY 4/1/2027</p>
<p>TYPE TOPRS	   YIELD 8.20 PCT    FIRST PAY DATE 7/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Baa1			  PAY FREQ QUARTERLY</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS			  CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: Priced as four million $25 shares</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
